ne-200 text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700 transition\">\n      👉 夕日が見える海辺の温泉宿おすすめ10選！絶景サンセット\n    </a>\n  \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900\">🎌 都道府県・地域別特集</h4>\n      <a href=\"/posts/kyoto-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block p-3 rounded-xl bg-amber-50/70 hover:bg-amber-100/80 border border-amber-200 text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 transition\">🏨 【京都府】厳選ホテル・旅館特集を見る</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/hokkaido-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-orange-700\">🏨 【北海道】厳選10選ガイド</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/tokyo-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-orange-700\">🏨 【東京】厳選10選ガイド</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/kyoto-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-orange-700\">🏨 【京都】厳選10選ガイド</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/okinawa-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-orange-700\">🏨 【沖縄】厳選10選ガイド</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n  \n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50/70 via-stone-50 to-emerald-50/50 border border-amber-200/90 rounded-3xl space-y-4 shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-amber-200 pb-2\">\n    🔍 ユーザーが気になる宿泊ポイント＆本音チェック\n  </h3>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900 block mb-1\">♨️ 温泉・客室の快適さ</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">足を伸ばせる大浴場や露天風呂、清潔でゆったり過ごせる客室空間。旅や出張の疲れを心地よくリフレッシュできます。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900 block mb-1\">🍽️ 食事・地元グルメ</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">京都府の旬の地元食材